'''Yolahn Square''' was an area in the middle of [[Iziz]], the [[capital]] [[city]] of [[Onderon]], during the [[Clone Wars]]. It was located at the foot of the [[Unifar Temple]], the residence of the [[King]] of [[Onderon]].<ref name="War Two Fronts" />

